[46.552773, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDataset reviewed\u001b[22m:\u001b[23G\u001b[38;5;153mcustomer-churn-v3\u001b[41G\u001b[39m\u2014\u001b[43Gmonthly\u001b[51Gcustomer\u001b[60Gsnapshots\u001b[70G(~14\u001b[75Grows/customer_id),\u001b[94Gschema\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bis \u001b[38;5;153mcustomer_id, snapshot_month, tenur\u001b[41G_months, monthly_charges, num_support_tickets, churned\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsplit is \u001b[1mrow-wise random\u001b[28G\u001b[22m(leaks\u001b[35Gacross\u001b[42Gtrain/val/test\u001b[57Gfor\u001b[61Gper-customer\u001b[74Gmodels).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;153mcustomer-churn-v3.1\u001b[39m has the same data with a \u001b[1mcustomer_id-grouped\u001b[22m split (no leakage)\u001b[87G\u2014 rec\u001b[93Gmmended\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor modeling.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'\u001b[6Gl an\u001b[11Gwer bob's questions \u001b[32Gs they come in o\u001b[49Ger agent-talk, using these fi\u001b[79Ges as\u001b[85Gground\u001b[92Gtruth.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWake monitor armed.\u001b[23G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u273b\u001b[3GCogitated for 1m 12s \u00b7 2 monitors still running\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mMonitor event: \"Wake\u001b[24Gmonitor\u001b[32Gfor\u001b[36Galice's\u001b[44Ginbox\u001b[50G\u2014\u001b[52Gdetects\u001b[60Gnew\u001b[64Gmessages\u001b[73Gfrom\u001b[78Gbob\"\r\u001b[2B\u001b["]
[46.552892, "o", "38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mSkill\u001b[22m(agent-talk:send)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mSuccessfully\u001b[19Gloaded\u001b[26Gskill\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand\u2026\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf  $ retalk send --peer bob \"v3 is row-wise random split (70/15/15), NOT grouped by customer_id \u2014 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;246msame customer can appear in train/val/test, so it leaks for per-customer models. Use \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bcustomer-churn-v3.1 instead: same schema/rows but GroupShuffleSplit on customer_id (70/15/15), \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;246mno customer crosses spli\u2026\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
